join detective right
detective: What can you tell me about the Count's cook?
join guard left
guard: I think she's probably the nicest one here. Very down-to-earth.
guard: We had a few minutes to chat outside the front of the manor, after she came out to tell me what had happened to Dracula.
guard: Very considerate of her, since I was not to leave my post.
guard: Unfortunately for her, that friend of Dracula's, [FRIEND], was out for blood.
guard: In the metaphorical sense, that is. ([COOK] loves that phrase)
guard: [FRIEND] was at her throat for a while after she went back inside.
guard: Wish I could've helped more.
